    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλω-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
